Required Relationship:  n > m











 Create a function f: [n] \rightarrow [m] that is NOT injective (one-to-one) and NOT surjective (onto). What is the required relationship between n and m? (One of: n  >m or n < m or n = m or "none.")






\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=.8]


